---
import monsters from '../data/monsters.json';
const monsterCount = monsters.length;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="description" content="evonymasters: a growing independent Evony: The King's Return player reference for monster rewards, generals, events and building upgrades."/>
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/>
<title>Evony: The King's Return · Player tools | evonymasters</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#eaf0f8;background:#0c1726}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit}.wrap{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px}header{border-bottom:1px solid #30445c;background:#11243a}.nav{min-height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.brand{font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-decoration:none}.brand span,.eyebrow,.arrow{color:#e6bc73}.nav small{color:#a9bcd0}.hero{padding:82px 0 76px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 12%,#234667 0,transparent 55%)}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.3vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.1;margin:18px 0;letter-spacing:-.045em;max-width:920px}h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem);letter-spacing:-.025em}.intro{max-width:730px;color:#bbccdd;line-height:1.75;font-size:1.12rem}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#e6bc73;color:#11243a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px}.button:hover{background:#f4d69f}.secondary{background:#203a52;color:#eaf0f8;border:1px solid #55708b}.secondary:hover{background:#294864}.section{padding:58px 0 72px}.section-intro{color:#b6c8d9;max-width:730px;line-height:1.7}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:30px}.card{background:#152b43;border:1px solid #35516d;border-radius:18px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;min-height:260px}.card.live{border-color:#b58d50;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#203b52,#152b43)}.card h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin:0}.card p{color:#b6c8d9;line-height:1.65;margin:0}.card .action{margin-top:auto;padding-top:10px;font-weight:800;color:#e6bc73;text-decoration:none}.badge{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em;color:#a9bed1}.live .badge{color:#9ce0ae}.count{color:#b6c8d9;font-size:.86rem}footer{border-top:1px solid #30445c;padding:28px 0;color:#a9bdcf;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:680px){.hero{padding:55px 0}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{min-height:220px}.nav small{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/">evony<span>masters</span></a><small>Independent Evony player reference</small></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">Evony: The King's Return · Player tools</div>
<h1>Everything you need to know about Evony, in one place.</h1>
<p class="intro">Find the information you need to plan your next move in Evony: The King's Return. We're building one home for monster rewards, general comparisons, event guides and building upgrades—with searchable tools that make game data easier to use.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/resources/">Find the resource you are missing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="#tools">Explore player tools <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</div></section>
<section id="tools" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Player tools</div><h2>Choose what you're working on</h2><p class="section-intro">Start with our monster resource finder. More tools are planned, and each will have the same searchable layout and detailed reference pages.</p>
<div class="grid">
<article class="card live"><div class="badge">Available now</div><h3>Find the resource you are missing</h3><p>Search monsters by name or reward. Compare power, stamina, possible drops and recorded chest contents, then open each monster's detail page.</p><div class="count">{monsterCount} monster records in the current catalog · data is still being expanded</div><a class="action" href="/resources/">Open Resource Finder <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
<article class="card"><div class="badge">Coming soon</div><h3>Generals</h3><p>Find any general and review their stats. Choose an eligible assistant general from a searchable selector and compare their stats side by side.</p><div class="action">General search and assistant comparison planned</div></article>
<article class="card"><div class="badge">Coming soon</div><h3>Events</h3><p>Search Evony events and open guides covering how each event works, how to participate and what to look out for.</p><div class="action">Searchable event guides planned</div></article>
<article class="card"><div class="badge">Coming soon</div><h3>Building Upgrades</h3><p>Search buildings, learn what each one does and see the requirements and resource costs to upgrade to a particular level.</p><div class="action">Building levels and upgrade costs planned</div></article>
</div></div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap">evonymasters is an independent fan-made player reference and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the game publisher. Game information may change with updates.</div></footer>
</body></html>
